## Output Format

### Synthesized Recommendations (UPDATED)
- **ID:** rec-XXX
- **Title:** [Concise]
- **Priority:** critical/high/medium/low
- **Expert Support:** X/{{ experts|length }} (High/Partial/Low)
- **Description:** [What changed]
- **Evolution:** [From iter {{ iteration - 1 }}: gained/lost/new/unchanged]

### Convergence Analysis
- **Current:** X%
- **Previous:** [From previous]%
- **Trend:** 📈 Improving / 📉 Declining / ➡️ Stable
- **Consensus:** ✅ Reached / ❌ Not reached

### Synthesized Questions (If Any)
- **ID:** q-XXX
- **Question:** [Clear, specific]
- **Why:** [Context]
- **Priority:** high/medium/low
- **Source:** [Which experts]

### Decision Signal
Choose ONE:
- ✅ **CONTINUE**: Consensus reached (≥80%), ready for artifact
- 🔄 **REFINE**: More iteration needed (< 80%)
- ⚠️ **BLOCKED**: Unanswered questions must be addressed

